 "segments": [
  {
   "start": 0.0,
   "end": 5.62,
   "text": "Find rock, deep in dirt, rock cold uranium. This not normal rock. Tell childhood friend",
   "avg_logprob": -0.211,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.046
  },
  {
   "start": 5.62,
   "end": 14.02,
   "text": "Grook to smell rock. Grook die. Rock got angry magic, but can't see magic. It too tiny.",
   "avg_logprob": -0.211,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.046
  },
  {
   "start": 14.4,
   "end": 21.04,
   "text": "But if smart man split rock, tiny part go crazy. One rock yell, over yell louder. Then suddenly,",
   "avg_logprob": -0.211,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.046
  },
  {
   "start": 21.42,
   "end": 28.52,
   "text": "boom. Not small boom. Biggest boom since volcano eat tribe chief first wife. To build skyfire bomb,",
   "avg_logprob": -0.211,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.046
  },
  {
   "start": 28.52,
   "end": 34.62,
   "text": "tribe need. Big brain man who read. Enchanted gray tube and 10,000 money from cave government.",
   "avg_logprob": -0.151,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.004
  },
  {
   "start": 35.2,
   "end": 38.82,
   "text": "Now put angry rock inside metal ball. Bow then go in tube to sleep.",
   "avg_logprob": -0.151,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.004
  },
  {
   "start": 39.46,
   "end": 44.7,
   "text": "Smart man build thing called trigger. Fancy name for clicky clicky fire now. Trigger use science",
   "avg_logprob": -0.151,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.004
  },
  {
   "start": 44.7,
   "end": 50.68,
   "text": "magic to press rock very hard until rock lose temper. Uranium like ex-girlfriend not stable.",
   "avg_logprob": -0.151,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.004
  },
  {
   "start": 51.1,
   "end": 56.9,
   "text": "And if you push, everything explode way out of proportion. When bomb go boom, sky turn white.",
   "avg_logprob": -0.151,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.004
  },
  {
   "start": 56.9,
   "end": 63.16,
   "text": "If dark, it turn moon time back to sun time. You look, no no see again. You near, no no you again.",
   "avg_logprob": -0.14,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.026
  },
  {
   "start": 63.42,
   "end": 68.16,
   "text": "You far away. Fire wind get you, hair go bye bye, and you go cough cough cough.",
   "avg_logprob": -0.14,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.026
  },
  {
   "start": 68.58,
   "end": 72.62,
   "text": "After first big boom, tribe say. This bad, we never do again.",
   "avg_logprob": -0.14,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.026
  },
  {
   "start": 73.66,
   "end": 79.2,
   "text": "We make 10 more. Now other big tribe make many big boom. We say we no use unless you use.",
   "avg_logprob": -0.14,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.026
  },
  {
   "start": 79.68,
   "end": 85.64,
   "text": "Other tribe say. Same. Skyfire rock, most powerful thing me ever make. Also dumbest.",
   "avg_logprob": -0.14,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.026
  },
  {
   "start": 85.64,
   "end": 91.66,
   "text": "Like make giant spear that stab at both end. So lesson is, maybe not split magic rock.",
   "avg_logprob": -0.178,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.056
  },
  {
   "start": 92.14,
   "end": 97.66,
   "text": "Maybe stick to fire. Fire only cook food. Magic rock, cook planet.",
   "avg_logprob": -0.178,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.056
  }
 ],
